## Features

- Cobra subcommand tree with persistent flags
- Viper config with environment support
- Zap structured logging with verbose mode
- Build-time version injection via ldflags
- Unit and command tests

## Quick Start

```bash
go mod tidy
make build
./bin/{{ .binaryName }} --help
```

## Commands

```bash
{{ .binaryName }} greet Alice
{{ .binaryName }} greet --name Bob --shout
{{ .binaryName }} version
```

## Configuration

Configuration precedence:

1. CLI flags
2. Environment variables (`{{ .envPrefix }}_*`)
3. Config file (`$HOME/.{{ .binaryName }}.yaml` or `--config`)
4. Defaults

